    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>A section of your skin somewhere on your torso develops into a flexible skin flap where you can store small items (Carries 1). The skin pouch is easy to conceal and you gain Stealth +20 if trying to hide it from someone who’s frisking or inspecting you. Each additional time you gain this mutation you gain Carries +1.</p>"
